#PRAGMA target=aarch64-baremetal
/* Basic arithmetic, control flow, and calls */

△ add ○ a ─ UINT64 ─ b ─ UINT64 ─ UINT64 ═╗
║ · sum ─ UINT64 ─ a + b ◇
║ → sum ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝

△ compute ○ n ─ UINT64 ─ UINT64 ═╗
║ · total ─ UINT64 ─ 0 ◇
║ · i ─ UINT64 ─ 0 ◇
║ ⁿ i < n ═╗
║ ║ total ─ total + i ◇
║ ║ i ─ i + 1 ◇
║ ╚═══ 2 ═══╝
║ Φ total > 100 ═╗
║ ║ total ─ 100 ◇
║ ▽ ═╗
║ ║ total ─ total + 1 ◇
║ ╚═══ 2 ═══╝
║ → total ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝

△ main ○ VOID ═╗
║ · x ─ UINT64 ─ add ○ 3 ─ 4 ◇
║ · y ─ UINT64 ─ compute ○ 10 ◇
║ println ○ x ◇
║ Φ x △ y ═╗
║ ║ println ○ 1 ◇
║ ╚═══ 2 ═══╝
║ ∅ ◇
║ → 0 ◇
╚═══ 1 ═══╝
